In Stranglethorn Vale, a Gnome Warlock named Zephyr was on a quest to level up his warlock skills. He was particularly interested in the succubus, a creature that was often seen as the better choice for leveling and questing. However, Zephyr was surprised to see a succubus with him, even though the succubus was usually the better choice for leveling and questing. This was because the succubus was more common than perceived, and Zephyr was not aware of this fact. [end of text]


